# ============================================================================
# XJSON / json-runtime  --  manifest-driven JSON/XCFE object-server runtime
# ============================================================================
# Track source: C++ runtime (src/), vendored build headers (lib/), the XJSON
# contract manifests (*.manifest.json), action implementations (*Actions.js,
# actions/), programs/, sco/, CMake, docs. Exclude build output and artifacts.
# ============================================================================

